        <h5 class="mt-0">Linux</h5>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-success" href="/cert/pem" target="_blank">ðŸ” Get mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-info show-instructions" href="#Linux" id="Linux">ðŸ“–
            Show Instructions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-info hide-instructions" href="#/">ðŸ“– Hide Instructions</a>
        <div class="instructions">
    <h5>Ubuntu/Debian</h5>
    <ol>
        <li><code>mv mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem /usr/local/share/ca-certificates/mitmproxy.crt</code></li>
        <li><code>sudo update-ca-certificates</code></li>
    </ol>
    <h5>Fedora</h5>
    <ol>
        <li><code>mv mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem /etc/pki/ca-trust/source/anchors/</code></li>
        <li><code>sudo update-ca-trust</code></li>
    </ol>
    <h5>Arch Linux</h5>
    <ol>
        <code>sudo trust anchor --store mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem</code>
    </ol>
    </div>
    </div>
</li>
