        <h5 class="mt-0">Firefox <small>(does not use the OS root certificates)</small></h5>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-success" href="/cert/pem" target="_blank">ðŸ” Get mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-info show-instructions" href="#Firefox" id="Firefox">ðŸ“–
            Show Instructions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-info hide-instructions" href="#/">ðŸ“– Hide Instructions</a>
        <div class="instructions">
    <h5>Firefox</h5>
    <ol>
        <li>Open <samp>Options -> Privacy &amp; Security</samp> and click <samp>View Certificates...</samp>
            at the bottom of the page.</li>
